WEBVTT

00:00:14.432 --> 00:00:16.100
Now passing Saman Lookout.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.353
Speed, 180. Bearing correction,
5 degrees starboard.

00:00:19.604 --> 00:00:22.148
Distance to Turan royal city of lglasia, 400.

00:00:22.398 --> 00:00:23.774
Okay!

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:29.405
This contains strategic instructions
pertaining to the capital's defense.

00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:32.575
You must personally give it to Father.

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:36.621
Get off the Lasas and return to
lglasia without you, in other words?

00:00:37.705 --> 00:00:41.417
No! I'm going to stay and fight too!

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.169
Millia.

00:00:43.419 --> 00:00:47.381
Please. Be by Father's side.

00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:52.970
Sister?

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:57.099
Let's meet again in lglasia.

00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:02.980
Please be careful, Sister.

00:01:07.151 --> 00:01:08.527
I leave her in your hands.

00:01:08.778 --> 00:01:14.158
Are you really sure? Wouldn't a
Turan pilot be a much better choice?

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:19.914
You can outfly anyone in
these skies. Isn't that right?

00:01:20.957 --> 00:01:22.375
<i>"Yes!
"Y es!</i>

00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:26.462
She's got a sharp eye, that's for sure!

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:29.674
Guess she's taken notice of my talent, huh?

00:01:31.384 --> 00:01:33.261
Are you okay? Are you scared?

00:01:33.511 --> 00:01:35.846
L-I am not scared!

00:01:36.097 --> 00:01:40.476
I'm just not sure if we can
really trust Sky Pirates or not...

00:01:40.726 --> 00:01:43.854
We're about to enter a jet stream.
Please hold on to Fam.

00:01:44.105 --> 00:01:45.773
Jet?

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:48.276
What is this?!

00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:10.381
As payment, we will give you 20 tons
of wheat, 40 tons of Claudia ore,

00:02:10.631 --> 00:02:14.802
and grant you the right to trade freely
in Turan territory for two years.

00:02:15.052 --> 00:02:16.345
Very good.

00:02:16.595 --> 00:02:21.350
In exchange, Kartoffel will
spare no effort to assist Turan.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.644
--Princess!
--Princess Liliana!

00:02:23.894 --> 00:02:27.064
--We're with you all the way!
--Can I get your autograph?!

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.527
Thank you.

00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:36.365
Under normal circumstances,
this ship would already belong to you.

00:02:36.615 --> 00:02:40.369
Even with some clipped wings,
the Lasas remains beautiful.

00:02:40.619 --> 00:02:42.705
Indeed.

00:02:42.955 --> 00:02:48.044
Kartoffel will look after any Turan
soldiers who were wounded in battle.

00:02:48.294 --> 00:02:51.881
--Huh?
--Good tailwinds.

00:02:52.131 --> 00:02:56.635
Yes. I leave the soldiers
and my sister in your hands.

00:02:59.055 --> 00:03:00.848
I guess "Fam Fan Fan" is the only choice!

00:03:01.098 --> 00:03:02.725
C-Come again?

00:03:02.975 --> 00:03:05.186
You know, the ship you gave us.

00:03:05.436 --> 00:03:07.772
I'm gonna rename it after this battle is over!

00:03:08.022 --> 00:03:11.275
--Exit the jet stream in 50 seconds.
--Th-That's nonsense!

00:03:11.525 --> 00:03:14.028
Turan's flagship is already named the Lasas!

00:03:14.278 --> 00:03:16.322
Don't go giving it a weird name!

00:03:16.572 --> 00:03:18.949
How mean, calling someone's name "weird"...

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:20.576
S-Someone's name...?

00:03:20.826 --> 00:03:23.621
Y-Yes. Fam is sort of her name.

00:03:23.871 --> 00:03:27.208
--Ten seconds, Fam.
--What do you mean, "sort of"?

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:28.584
I'm Fam Fan Fan.

00:03:28.834 --> 00:03:29.919
She's Giselle Collette.

00:03:30.169 --> 00:03:32.588
Three. Two. One.

00:03:32.838 --> 00:03:34.965
--Exit!
--Right!

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:44.350
So, as of tomorrow, that ship
will be the "Fam Fan Fan"!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.310
L-I refuse to accept that!

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.146
Umm, it belongs to me now, you know.

00:03:49.397 --> 00:03:51.607
That was my agreement with Princess Lily.

00:03:51.857 --> 00:03:54.360
My sister is a kind,
wonderful woman, you know...

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:58.364
Yeah, she really is! So?

00:03:58.614 --> 00:04:03.702
I refuse to let you swindle my kind
sister and change the Lasas' name!

00:04:21.637 --> 00:04:23.764
According to reports from Fort Zwiebel,

00:04:24.014 --> 00:04:27.560
the Federation fleets have
regrouped over the BolClr islands

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:30.646
and are now continuing their advance on lglasia.

00:04:30.896 --> 00:04:35.151
Six ship-of-the-line fleets
and four siege ship fleets...

00:04:35.401 --> 00:04:37.862
Even siege ships now?

00:04:38.112 --> 00:04:41.157
And that's where the Impetus is...

00:04:41.407 --> 00:04:45.453
I also got word that they
just passed Saman Lookout.

00:04:45.703 --> 00:04:47.371
They' re surprisingly slow.

00:04:47.621 --> 00:04:49.832
Aside from the amazingly swift 4th Fleet,

00:04:50.082 --> 00:04:52.668
Federation ships are rather sluggish.

00:04:52.918 --> 00:04:56.464
Their firepower and armor
are the issue, though...

00:04:56.714 --> 00:04:59.675
We'll strike the Impetus with the Lasas herself!

00:04:59.925 --> 00:05:04.930
Our fleet will pierce the heart of
the enemy as a single, sharp drill.

00:05:05.181 --> 00:05:08.225
If we can take out Premier Luscinia
of the Ades Federation...

00:05:09.727 --> 00:05:11.896
...their fleets will crumble.

00:05:25.618 --> 00:05:26.535
Can you walk?

00:05:26.785 --> 00:05:29.955
Of course I can! I don't need your help!

00:05:30.206 --> 00:05:32.374
Due to heavy fog in the Belhall region,

00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:36.670
the 15:02 flight to Madiran
will now stop at Huelva.

00:05:36.921 --> 00:05:38.422
--The Madiran flight is over here!
--Thank goodness you're all right!

00:05:38.672 --> 00:05:40.633
--Hurry!
--We were so worried!

00:05:43.636 --> 00:05:45.262
Princess Millia!

00:05:46.305 --> 00:05:48.140
Marianne!

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.975
Thank goodness you're all right!

00:05:50.226 --> 00:05:55.105
It's okay. Now that I'm back, I won't
let the Federation lay a hand on us!

00:05:56.524 --> 00:05:57.566
Yes.

00:05:57.816 --> 00:06:03.864
Don't worry. My sister has entrusted
me with a way to protect this land.

00:06:07.326 --> 00:06:10.579
--Millia...
--Father!

00:06:10.829 --> 00:06:12.831
Thank goodness you're alive...

00:06:13.082 --> 00:06:15.584
Yes. Sister is safe as well.

00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:18.629
She is? I'm relieved to hear it...

00:06:20.839 --> 00:06:23.884
She says to use this to protect the royal city.

00:06:31.517 --> 00:06:33.435
Liliana...

00:06:40.651 --> 00:06:44.029
I've already evacuated the citizens.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.991
You must leave immediately too...

00:06:47.241 --> 00:06:48.701
What about you?

00:06:48.951 --> 00:06:51.537
I will stay and see
everything through to the end.

00:06:51.787 --> 00:06:53.872
Then I'm staying too.

00:06:54.123 --> 00:06:55.916
Even if our land is taken,

00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:59.628
Turan will never fall as long
as it has a ruler and its people.

00:06:59.878 --> 00:07:04.300
Millia. You are the one person who must live on.

00:07:05.843 --> 00:07:08.804
Sister had this in mind from the very start...

00:07:09.054 --> 00:07:11.098
You there. Are you Sky Pirates?

00:07:11.348 --> 00:07:13.726
--Yes.
--Come closer.

00:07:15.644 --> 00:07:18.856
I thank you for bringing Millia here.

00:07:19.106 --> 00:07:21.483
Oh, I-it was nothing...

00:07:21.734 --> 00:07:28.198
You must be very skilled pilots
for Liliana to entrust Millia to you...

00:07:30.743 --> 00:07:34.705
Please continue to look after Millia...

00:07:34.955 --> 00:07:36.415
--Yes.
--Yes.

00:07:40.044 --> 00:07:43.672
Accept that ring as payment.

00:07:43.922 --> 00:07:47.301
Please take my daughter Millia to the
imperial villa in the east, where it is safe...

00:07:47.551 --> 00:07:49.845
Father!

00:07:50.095 --> 00:07:56.185
Do not cry. You are our only hope, Millia.

00:07:56.435 --> 00:08:00.397
You are Turan's only hope, and mine...

00:08:05.611 --> 00:08:08.280
Father, huh...?

00:08:13.118 --> 00:08:15.621
Why can't they all just run away?

00:08:15.871 --> 00:08:16.747
Fam...

00:08:16.997 --> 00:08:20.376
Millia, too! Why can't they all
just run away with their father?

00:08:20.626 --> 00:08:24.546
It'll all be for nothing if the
kingdom survives but he dies...

00:08:24.797 --> 00:08:26.674
Don't you agree, Gisey?

00:08:35.307 --> 00:08:38.268
Let's go. To the imperial villa in the east.

00:08:45.526 --> 00:08:48.195
ETA to Turan, 1800 hours.

00:08:48.445 --> 00:08:51.573
Main Turan forces have been deployed
to the fore of the royal city of lglasia.

00:08:51.824 --> 00:08:53.701
They're prepared to fight to the death.

00:08:53.951 --> 00:08:57.788
King Turan understands the
reason behind this battle.

00:08:58.038 --> 00:09:00.582
He knows it's about annihilation.

00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:02.710
All ships, prepare to attack.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:06.255
Set the Turan forces and the royal city
of lglasia ablaze with full force!

00:09:06.505 --> 00:09:09.133
Display our resolve for all the world to see!

00:09:09.383 --> 00:09:13.721
The Federation forces
traditionally favor visual patrolling,

00:09:13.971 --> 00:09:16.932
and they've improved
their technology to that end.

00:09:17.182 --> 00:09:21.895
If the Federation believes we and
the Lasas sank into the Grand Lake,

00:09:22.146 --> 00:09:24.773
we should be able to catch them off guard.

00:09:25.023 --> 00:09:29.695
If we can find the Impetus first,
victory will be ours!

00:09:44.877 --> 00:09:46.462
Impetus located.

00:09:46.712 --> 00:09:50.549
Five miles off Cape Aster,
heading south toward lglasia.

00:09:57.389 --> 00:09:59.558
Instruct all ships to go to silent running!

00:09:59.808 --> 00:10:04.480
Our one and only target is Luscinia's
command ship... the Impetus!

00:10:09.234 --> 00:10:11.820
Our one and only target is Luscinia Héfez!

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.697
Destroy him with full force!

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:17.951
Turan fleet approaching!
15 ships, including the Lasas!

00:10:18.202 --> 00:10:20.496
So she did survive...

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.624
Lukia...

00:10:59.701 --> 00:11:02.704
Full battle speed! Sink the Impetus!

00:11:06.875 --> 00:11:08.877
Enemy flagship Lasas, approaching from above!

00:11:09.127 --> 00:11:10.587
E-Evade!

00:11:31.149 --> 00:11:33.151
All right! They got this in the bag!

00:11:41.952 --> 00:11:44.288
Wham?! What happened to the Lasas?!

00:12:54.149 --> 00:12:56.693
Approximately 200 miles
to the eastern imperial villa.

00:12:56.944 --> 00:12:58.528
It'll take about four hours.

00:12:58.779 --> 00:13:00.948
Should we stop by Kartoffel first?

00:13:01.198 --> 00:13:04.284
They're taking care of
injured Turans, as I recall...

00:13:05.494 --> 00:13:07.579
Be strong, Princess.

00:13:07.829 --> 00:13:10.624
You'll only disappoint the people
of Turan with such a glum look.

00:13:10.874 --> 00:13:12.793
L-I'm well aware of that.

00:13:13.043 --> 00:13:15.337
Yeah, huh?

00:13:15.587 --> 00:13:17.673
Okay! Let's get going!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.058
Bio?!

00:13:33.271 --> 00:13:35.107
They've abducted Princess Lily!

00:13:35.357 --> 00:13:36.400
They took my sister?!

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.360
The Lasas' bridge crew was slaughtered.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:42.823
I think they might've taken her to the Impetus...

00:13:47.452 --> 00:13:49.371
Save her!

00:13:49.621 --> 00:13:52.708
Please! Save her! Save my sister!

00:13:52.958 --> 00:13:55.252
Take me there! Right this minute!

00:13:55.502 --> 00:13:56.545
Princess Millia?

00:13:56.795 --> 00:13:58.588
They're going to kill her!

00:13:58.839 --> 00:14:01.508
Please! Save my sister!

00:14:03.635 --> 00:14:05.303
I beg of you...!

00:14:09.683 --> 00:14:12.811
Gisey! Do you know the
inner workings of the Impetus?

00:14:26.658 --> 00:14:28.869
--Here we go!
--Roger!

00:14:49.473 --> 00:14:51.683
Gisey! Can we enter from the flight deck?

00:14:51.933 --> 00:14:55.187
No. Her defenses are strongest there.

00:14:55.437 --> 00:14:57.647
Our best bet is between the rotary propellers!

00:14:57.898 --> 00:14:59.566
I'll act as a decoy!

00:15:08.617 --> 00:15:10.243
Multiple Sky Pirate ships below!

00:15:10.494 --> 00:15:13.497
Forget 'em! The only weapons
they have are harpoons!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.972
We're gonna dive into the Sky-Fish!

00:15:33.642 --> 00:15:36.478
W-We're going inside...?! You can't be serious!

00:15:45.821 --> 00:15:47.030
I'm turning right!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.282
No! Go back!

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.997
Claudia ships have five
ventilation openings ahead!

00:15:56.248 --> 00:15:57.499
Enter the pipe at <i>9</i> o'clock!

00:15:57.749 --> 00:15:59.209
R°gefl

00:16:04.631 --> 00:16:07.425
Maintain speed and turn right in eight seconds!

00:16:07.676 --> 00:16:11.179
Five! Four! Three! Two! One!

00:16:11.429 --> 00:16:12.848
Now!

00:16:17.727 --> 00:16:19.521
Huh? A general passageway?!

00:16:19.771 --> 00:16:21.314
Is it because of repair work?!

00:16:21.565 --> 00:16:23.859
We need to find a map of the ship!

00:16:32.284 --> 00:16:35.579
Through the lower deck Claudia tanks
and parametron computation room,

00:16:35.829 --> 00:16:37.998
up the main artillery hoist elevator,

00:16:38.248 --> 00:16:41.960
and then through the
cooling tower and air ducts...

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.796
--Can we do it?
--Yeah.

00:16:45.046 --> 00:16:48.592
I think we can keep using the vents.
They should get us there...

00:16:48.842 --> 00:16:50.427
Are you okay?

00:16:52.095 --> 00:16:53.346
I'm fine.

00:16:53.597 --> 00:16:57.017
But, please, it's my sister
you should be worried about.

00:16:57.267 --> 00:17:01.271
I know. We <i>will</i> rescue Princess Lily!

00:17:03.064 --> 00:17:06.526
We've lost sight of the
Sky Pirate ship near the vents!

00:17:06.776 --> 00:17:10.780
Send gunners to every exit!
Eliminate them on sight!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.117
Two! One!

00:17:14.367 --> 00:17:15.744
Now!

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.803
Are you--?g

00:17:34.054 --> 00:17:35.764
Luscinia Héfez!

00:17:37.807 --> 00:17:40.977
Where is my sister?! Release her at once!

00:17:41.228 --> 00:17:42.896
--Intruders!
--Send gunners!

00:17:43.146 --> 00:17:45.357
--Give permission to shoot!
--Premier Luscinia!

00:17:45.607 --> 00:17:48.318
Silence! Do not open fire!

00:17:49.945 --> 00:17:52.030
Have you heard of the "Exiles"?

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.701
The Exiles are detestable ships...

00:17:56.952 --> 00:17:59.913
In the cataclysmic days of yore,
they served as emigrant vessels

00:18:00.163 --> 00:18:05.043
to help people flee this world and carry
them into the furthest reaches of the sky.

00:18:07.212 --> 00:18:13.885
And once the calamitous times were over,
they nonchalantly returned.

00:18:14.135 --> 00:18:18.181
But there was no longer any land to be given

00:18:18.431 --> 00:18:21.726
to those who had abandoned
and fled the suffering world.

00:18:22.936 --> 00:18:25.772
I'm not here for a history lecture!

00:18:26.022 --> 00:18:27.816
Bring out my sister!

00:18:28.066 --> 00:18:31.361
You people should never have returned.

00:18:32.445 --> 00:18:34.114
Sister!

00:18:34.364 --> 00:18:37.117
Put the gun down, Millia.

00:18:37.367 --> 00:18:38.285
Sister...?!

00:18:38.535 --> 00:18:40.328
You win, Luscinia.

00:18:40.578 --> 00:18:43.999
Turan surrenders to the Ades Federation.

00:18:44.249 --> 00:18:45.667
Sister...

00:18:45.917 --> 00:18:49.754
Please, just don't hurt Millia!

00:18:50.005 --> 00:18:52.882
Surrender is not an option in this battle.

00:18:53.967 --> 00:18:56.511
The only way to restore peace to the world

00:18:56.761 --> 00:19:01.182
is to have overabundant
nations fall and people die.

00:19:01.433 --> 00:19:03.893
That's your desire?!

00:19:04.144 --> 00:19:09.024
Have you... Have you forgotten
the sadness of the Grand Race?!

00:19:09.274 --> 00:19:11.526
Farahn5z's feelings?!

00:19:11.776 --> 00:19:13.570
Let my sister go!

00:19:15.739 --> 00:19:20.744
"That which is born from
the blue surface of water..."

00:19:32.964 --> 00:19:34.966
What? What just happened?!

00:19:35.216 --> 00:19:37.093
What have you done to my sister?!

00:19:41.014 --> 00:19:45.060
"A single word, a single thought."

00:19:48.855 --> 00:19:50.273
Sister!

00:19:55.236 --> 00:19:59.115
Yes. <i>This</i> is my desire, Liliana!

00:20:02.202 --> 00:20:05.121
"May our serenity be everlasting!"

00:20:09.542 --> 00:20:11.044
Fan'!

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.080
What's going on?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.833
--Why are they retreating?!
--Have we weathered the attack?!

00:20:57.465 --> 00:21:00.510
--What is that?!
--A new Federation weapon?!

00:21:03.138 --> 00:21:05.014
Fire! Shoot it down!

00:21:05.265 --> 00:21:07.350
An Exile...?!

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.352
Don't shoot!

00:21:20.238 --> 00:21:24.284
You have always served me well. I thank you.

00:21:24.534 --> 00:21:28.705
No, I thank you for allowing
me such a fulfilling life.

00:21:28.955 --> 00:21:30.582
I see...

00:21:30.832 --> 00:21:32.792
O, Grand Lake.

00:21:33.042 --> 00:21:38.339
Please give the people of Turan and
my daughters your divine protection...

00:22:04.449 --> 00:22:07.035
Gisey...! Gisey!

00:22:07.285 --> 00:22:08.244
Fam...

00:22:08.495 --> 00:22:10.121
ls the princess okay?!

00:22:17.504 --> 00:22:19.088
Millia!

00:22:31.643 --> 00:22:38.233
<i>Soko ni nani ga aru toshite mo</i>

00:22:38.483 --> 00:22:46.908
<i>Mikai no ryouiki e kimi to</i>

00:22:55.166 --> 00:23:03.216
<i>Mijikai yume wo miteta ima</i>

00:23:03.466 --> 00:23:07.845
<i>Are wa kimi no senaka</i>

00:23:08.096 --> 00:23:14.018
<i>Kako? Mirai?</i>

00:23:14.269 --> 00:23:24.779
<i>Furikitte iru meetaa no hari wo mushi shite</i>

00:23:25.029 --> 00:23:27.907
<i>Oikaze to kanjou no muku hou e</i>

00:23:28.157 --> 00:23:34.080
<i>Habataku tabi kizukasareru</i>

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:39.627
<i>Nido to deaenai sora ga aru koto</i>

00:23:39.877 --> 00:23:45.133
<i>Sore demo tobitatsu nara</i>

00:23:45.383 --> 00:23:51.931
<i>Kimi no tsubasa ni naru watashi ga</i>

00:24:03.443 --> 00:24:04.694
<i>H-Hey, Millia.</i>

00:24:04.944 --> 00:24:06.904
<i>Gisey's actually a really good cook!</i>

00:24:07.155 --> 00:24:09.449
<i>She's got a big family and is
always helping out and stuff!</i>

00:24:09.699 --> 00:24:12.452
<i>--Fam...
--And potato pancakes are her specialty!</i>

00:24:12.702 --> 00:24:14.454
<i>They're pancakes made from potatoes.</i>

00:24:14.704 --> 00:24:18.041
<i>There's not much land here,
so potatoes are all we can really grow.</i>

00:24:18.291 --> 00:24:19.042
Hey, Fam...

00:24:19.292 --> 00:24:26.341
<i>Potato pancakes are nice and warm
and make you feel good all over!</i>

00:24:26.591 --> 00:24:29.469
<i>So cheer up, MiHia!</i>
